  {
    "id": 4901035120020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーどういうのが好きなのかなって\r\nわかんなかったから……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしがいいかも！　って思ったのを\r\n全部詰めてもらいました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか！\r\nじゃあ期待できるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えぇー？　プロデューサーが嬉しいものかは\r\nわかんないし……あと……あれ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ジャケ買いを……しました……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ、気になるな\r\nどれだ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "この星のやつ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お湯が群青色になって、\r\n黄色の小さい星がいっぱい散らばって溶けるんだって！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたちだ！！\r\nって思って買っちゃった……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103512/4901035120080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ！　それは楽しみだな……！\r\n今日早速使おうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035120090,
